abstract: >-
  Research software for knowledge-guided multi-graph herb recommendation
  with LLM-generated weak syndrome supervision. Includes the core model,
  fixed study inputs, paper configuration, and implementation checks.
  MIT applies to the original software; data reuse is governed separately
  as described in README.md under Data sources and licensing. The package does not contain
  all original run logs, baseline implementations, or figure-analysis scripts.
keywords:
